    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 20,
    "summary": "The Lord sends Ammon to Middoni to deliver his imprisoned brethren—Ammon and Lamoni meet Lamoni’s father, who is king over all the land—Ammon compels the old king to approve the release of his brethren. About 90 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
