        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 20:6",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And he said unto Ammon: Come, I will go with thee down to the land of Middoni, and there I will plead with the king that he will cast thy brethren out of prison.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 20:7",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that as Ammon and Lamoni were journeying thither, they met the father of Lamoni, who was king over all the land.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 114,
            "end": 118,
            "text": "Alma 22:1."
          }
