        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And he also said: Whither art thou going with this Nephite, who is one of the children of a liar?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 92,
            "end": 96,
            "text": "Mosiah 10:16 (12–17)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 20:10",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that Lamoni rehearsed unto him whither he was going, for he feared to offend him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 20:11",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And he also told him all the cause of his tarrying in his own kingdom, that he did not go unto his father to the feast which he had prepared.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 20:12",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And now when Lamoni had rehearsed unto him all these things, behold, to his astonishment, his father was angry with him, and said: Lamoni, thou art going to deliver these Nephites, who are sons of a liar. Behold, he robbed our fathers; and now his children are also come amongst us that they may, by their cunning and their lyings, deceive us, that they again may rob us of our property.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 20:13",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Now the father of Lamoni commanded him that he should slay Ammon with the sword. And he also commanded him that he should not go to the land of Middoni, but that he should return with him to the land of Ishmael.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 203,
            "end": 210,
            "text": "Alma 17:19."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 17:19.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 17:19",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 17,
