        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "Now when Ammon had said these words unto him, he answered him, saying: I know that if I should slay my son, that I should shed innocent blood; for it is thou that hast sought to destroy him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 20:19",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And he stretched forth his hand to slay Ammon. But Ammon withstood his blows, and also smote his arm that he could not use it.",
        "footNotes": [],
